	(text "Keys: the two-button interim ladder (PLAN-ESP32.md 3.1): OK 0 V, NAV 1.62 V, none 3.12 V.\nReceiver taps: 10 k in series, enough for the KR-331's 3.3 V logic (tools/rc-scope).\nUnknown receiver: tools/rc-scope first, with 10 k from D3 to GND as a divider. CH1 by\nunplugging the servo or with a Y-cable; CH2 needs a Y-cable, the ESC powering the\nreceiver through it. The receiver's + rail stays off the XIAO, which runs from USB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a88017c-490c-4eb5-b8d6-1372eb792fc8")
	)
	(text "GNSS: the module's TX to D7, the XIAO's RX; its RX to D6, the XIAO's TX. Swapped, the\nlink shows no byte at any baud rate. 5 V from the 5V pad (3V3: ROADMAP.md step 1.3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "990a8a79-63e9-4e9c-a329-6a9882298094")
	)
	(text "XIAO pads, USB-C up, from the top: left D0 D1 D2 D3 D4 D5 D6, right 5V GND 3V3 D10 D9 D8 D7;\nBAT+ and BAT- on the back. The microSD of the Sense board takes D8 CLK, D9 DAT0, D10 CMD and\nGPIO21 for DAT3, inside: leave D8-D10 free. D1 is spare, for the optional aux channel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a644524b-1bf5-45cd-9c5e-056914e995db")
	)
